<title>USA: Payless September same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Payless September same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Payless Cashways Inc said Thursday its comparable store sales for the month of September rose 1.3 percent.</p>
<p>Actual sales for the five-week period ended September 28, however, were off one percent, at $264 million versus $267 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Same-store sales for the year to date fell three percent. Actual sales were off 3.3 percent at $2.197 billion, down from $2.272 billion.</p>
<p>Payless Cashways retails building materials.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
